  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The secret to Korean fried chicken's distinctive texture is "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "double frying ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "double-frying"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The second fry pushes the crust to a crispness that stays crunchy even after the sauce is added. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Choose either the soy-garlic glaze or the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gochujang",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "gochujang"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sauce. Both work well. Many households make half and half."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
